  "ingredients": [
    "1 medium eggplant (sliced crosswise)",
    "1 ounce pork rinds (crushed)",
    "4 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1 tablespoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "1/4 cup beef broth",
    "1 1/2 tablespoon coconut aminos",
    "1 tablespoon shaoxing cooking wine",
    "2 teaspoon low-carb brown sugar replacement",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "3 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "16 ounce ground pork",
    "0.15 teaspoon xanthan gum",
    "2 medium green onion (sliced, to garnish)",
    "1 teaspoon sesame seeds (to garnish)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Soak eggplant pieces in salted water. Cover and let sit for 10-15 minutes. Wash and drain.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork/#wprm-recipe-52671-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, in a wok, heat olive oil until hot. Add crushed red pepper flakes. Stir then remove from heat and let sit to steep. Strain.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork/#wprm-recipe-52671-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour half of the reserved oil over eggplant pieces to coat. Dredge slightly damp eggplant pieces in crushed pork rinds. Dry fry eggplant pieces. Remove and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork/#wprm-recipe-52671-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the sauce mixture, combine stock, tamari, Shaoxing wine, sweetener, and salt. Mix well. Set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork/#wprm-recipe-52671-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add remaining oil to the wok. Saute garlic until aromatic.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork/#wprm-recipe-52671-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add ground pork and cook until no longer pink.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork/#wprm-recipe-52671-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return eggplant pieces and pour in sauce mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork/#wprm-recipe-52671-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/07/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue to cook until the eggplant is soft and the sauce is reduced. Stir in xanthan gum, as necessary, to thicken the sauce. Garnish with scallions and toasted sesame seeds.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/spicy-eggplant-and-minced-pork/#wprm-recipe-52671-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
